    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: After the final whistle, the team celebrates their win. Archer waits until
      the others have left, then leads Liam into an empty club room and closes the
      door.
